  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "83DEAF0936B4C932",
      "text": "我又想起来～\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你滚橄榄的样子了。[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "83DEAE0936B4C77F",
      "text": "你当时的势头简直像是\\n太晶化成格斗属性了呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "83DEAD0936B4C5CC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，我这里是\\n你挑战的第几个道馆呢～？[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "83DEAC0936B4C419",
      "text": "圆模道馆离学校很近，\\n所以有很多训练家\\r\\n一上来就会选这里呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "83DEAB0936B4C266",
      "text": "因此首席要我像甜点一样，\\n下手要软～软的～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "83DEAA0936B4C0B3",
      "text": "可是我的虫儿们\\n总是输的话就太可怜了……[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "83DEA90936B4BF00",
      "text": "呵呵，遇到这种好机会，\\n我就能拿出真本领了。好兴奋哦～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "83DEB80936B4D87D",
      "text": "我会让你输得\\n体无完肤的～！[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "83DEB70936B4D6CA",
      "text": "你的身手不亚于首席，\\n让人回味无穷啊～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "83DBAA0936B28ADC",
      "text": "啊～！拿出真本领输掉对战，\\n这种感觉真舒服～！[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "83DBAB0936B28C8F",
      "text": "看来下手太过软～软的话，\\n对自己和对手可能都不太好啊～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "83DBAC0936B28E42",
      "text": "料理师傅海岱也和我说过\\n要更加学会做自己才行呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "83DBAD0936B28FF5",
      "text": "今后我会试着\\n做自己……多一点点！[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "83DBA60936B28410",
      "text": "要是有人说圆模道馆更难闯了，\\n我就找个借口说味道变苦了吧～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_15",
      "hash64": "83DBA70936B285C3",
      "text": "那么，\\n我们后会有期～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
